(7340910, 1146150, 153814, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think it was so bad those eye''s are just outstanding and really carry this image but thats as far as it goes.<br/>There is no trip around the face. What bothered me was the lack of focus on the face. It looks like to thin strips of focus down each side of her face. After the eyes I have nowhere to go. I gave you a 6. The eyes talked me in to it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-04-11 13:43:16.</i></td>', 'I didn''t think it was so bad those eye''s are just outstanding and really carry this image but thats as far as it goes.There is no trip around the face. What bothered me was the lack of focus on the face. It looks like to thin strips of focus down each side of her face. After the eyes I have nowhere to go. I gave you a 6. The eyes talked me in to it.', '2015-04-11 08:24:13.000000', '2015-04-11 14:43:16.000000', 0),
